+- Current failure: `<FAILURE_OUTPUT or "not captured; reproduce it first">`
+- Already ruled out / suspected: `<fill in or delete>`
+- Search tests often fail intermittently because of result ordering, debounce timers, async indexing, or fake vs. real timers. Run the file several times to check whether the failure is deterministic, and say what you found.
+
+**How to work:**
+1. Run `<TEST_CMD> <PATH>/search.test.js` (a few times) and record the exact failures, and whether they're stable, before you change anything.
